     "title": "Notes",
     "html": "<ul><li><b>“MT5 balance ≤ 10”</b> assumes balances are in dollars; Cent accounts may report cents.</li><li><b>Compliance review.</b> This journey reaches people who may just have lost money. S19 offers a</li></ul>\n<p>top-up and a smaller-scale option side by side, and every deposit request carries “Only deposit what you can afford to lose.”</p>"
