   "subject": "Back in your account? Topping up takes a minute",
   "preheader": "From $10, with most methods instant.",
   "button": "Make a deposit",
   "buttonTarget": "client area, Deposit",
   "bodyHtml": "<p>Hi {{first_name}},</p>\n<p>Good to see you back. If you'd like to trade again, you can add funds in the client area under Funds → Deposit. Deposits start at $10 and most methods are instant.</p>\n<p>If you want to ease back in, a Cent account keeps every position 100 times smaller.</p>\n<p>Only deposit what you can afford to lose.</p>"
